            "body": "> Yeah, `1-` being different from `-` feels wrong to me (is there precedent for this?).\r\n\r\n`{count}CTRL-G` is somewhat of a precedent.\r\n\r\n`1` serves no purpose otherwise, it's a wide open namespace for us to use in many mappings, similar to the bang \"!\" convention.",
